<mxCell id="c65" value="&lt;b&gt;Definitions.&lt;/b&gt; A transition without a box has guard None and reward r = 0.&lt;br&gt;new(): a fresh case. Claims and complaints: risk ~ U{0,1,2}, bad ~ Bernoulli(p&lt;sub&gt;risk&lt;/sub&gt;) with p = (0.1, 0.5, 0.9), and reworked = 0 for complaints; bad is not observable. Underwriting: task_type ~ U{0,1}.&lt;br&gt;d&lt;sub&gt;f&lt;/sub&gt; = 1 + U{0,1} (approve, resolve); d&lt;sub&gt;s&lt;/sub&gt;(Y) = 4 + U{0,1} for a normal clerk (skill = 0) and 2 + U{0,1} for an expert (skill = 1) (investigate, check).&lt;br&gt;d(X,Y) = 1 + U{0,1} if X.task_type = Y.code, else 7 + U{0,1}.&lt;br&gt;X' = X with reworked = 1 and bad = 0: a wrongly resolved complaint reopens after 2 time units." style="text;strokeColor=#666666;fillColor=#ffffff;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=7;spacingRight=7;spacingTop=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=14;fontFamily=Helvetica;" parent="1" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="-55.0" y="215.4" width="1068.0" height="141.4" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
</root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>